  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Britannia II or Britannia Secunda was part of the Diocese of \"the Britains\" created during the Diocletianic Reforms. It is included in the Verona List of the Roman provinces. Its administrative center may have been located at Eboracum (York).",
